# Path rules for scripts/port-pr.sh, from apache/iggy paths to paths in this
# repository. One rule per line: <old prefix> <new prefix>. The longest
# matching prefix wins. The script leaves a core path that no rule matches
# out of the patch. The new prefix - leaves the path out too, and the script
# lists it to port by hand.

